[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; zone_vale_floor — the orc valley (WLD-05; rebuilt for the map themes, 2026-09-23), band 7–11.
;
; A green valley between high rocks that the orcs have made theirs. The road runs west to east
; along the floor; the grunts camp by it, their axe-throwers keep a lookout on the north slope,
; stone golelings work a quarry in the south, and mushnub mystics tend a grove. The warlord holds
; a war camp walled in spikes at the north-east end. Three war-totem stones, the map's shards,
; stand south-west, north and south-east.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is
; coordinates. Generated by a script; edit the script, not this file.

